    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051126.0111\n\nMADRID, Nov. 26 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nThree air passengers arrested in Spain for bomb joke\n\n\n\n\nThree air passengers were put into police custody at Malaga airport in Spain on Saturday, for one of them joked that he had a bomb on board a plane from Stockholm.\n\nThe crew has overheard that one passenger told his friends he had a bomb on board the plane, according to Niels Blix, a spokesman for Sterling Airlines flight.\n\nHowever, the captain of the flight decided to carry on to Malaga and landed without incident. The Spanish police then detained the three passengers.",
